pro_course_detail.description:
This is an intensive course made for students that want to improve their pronunciation.

By the end of this course, you should be able to:
-  see improvement on your pronunciation;
-  speak clearly and increase your self-confidence in the way you speak;
-  know and correct you mispronounced words;
-  learn/be acquainted with the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA) symbols; and
-  speak in a neutral accent

* NOTE:
   Please bring a mirror during the lesson/practice/drill.
